🎬 Movie Booking Management System – Frontend Web Application

A fully functional, product-style Movie Ticket Booking System built using pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

This project simulates an online ticket reservation platform with seat selection, authentication, booking management, and an admin dashboard — all powered by LocalStorage (no backend required).

🚀 Live Features

🔐 User Registration & Login (LocalStorage-based authentication)

🎥 Browse Movies with Posters & Details

💺 Interactive Seat Selection System

🎟 Booking Confirmation with Unique Booking ID

📂 My Bookings Dashboard

❌ Cancel Booking Feature

🛠 Admin Panel (Add / Remove Movies)

💰 Revenue & Booking Analytics (Frontend Simulation)

📱 Fully Responsive Design

🌙 Modern Netflix-style Dark UI

🛠 Tech Stack

HTML5

CSS3

Vanilla JavaScript

Chrome LocalStorage API

No frameworks.
No backend.
No external database.

