💡 How It Works

User data is stored in LocalStorage

Seat availability is dynamically updated

Booked seats persist across sessions

Each booking generates a unique Booking ID

Admin panel provides revenue and booking insights

🎯 Key Functional Highlights
🔒 Authentication System

Secure form validation

Password strength checks

Session-based access control

💺 Smart Seat Management

Prevents double booking

Dynamic seat grid generation

Real-time price calculation

📊 Admin Analytics

Total bookings counter

Revenue tracking

Movie management

